  "title": "Maximum Subarray",
  "difficulty": "Medium",
  "topic": "Arrays",
  "description": "Given a list of integers `nums`, find the contiguous subarray (containing at least one number) with the **largest sum**, and return that sum.",
  "function_signature": {
    "name": "max_sub_array",
    "params": [
      {
        "name": "nums",
